# GBDI design system (Cursor rule)

The canonical rules are in `AGENTS.md` at the root of the gbdi-design-skill repo:
read it, then `README.md` from "Design principles" down, then `examples/home.html`.

- Tokens only: `var(--gbdi-*)` or `tokens.$…`. No raw hex outside the token files.
- SK Modernist for headings ≥ 32px, Satoshi for the rest. Never commit font files.
- Primary Green in small splashes; pastels only on hero cards, one set per page.
- Flat: 1px Green-Grey borders, no card shadows, no gradients.
- Every number has a unit and a source.
